    <string name="Eclipse.Role.Sheriff">Sheriff</string>
    <string name="Eclipse.Role.Sheriff.IntroBlurb">Shoot the Impostors. Choose carefully!</string>
    <string name="Eclipse.Role.Sheriff.MedDescription">A Crewmate who can shoot. A misfire applies the configured penalty and disables further shots.</string>
    <string name="Eclipse.Role.Sheriff.TabDescription">Use Shoot against a nearby player. Impostors are valid targets; known neutral categories follow their options. A misfire can kill you, your target, both or nobody, and always disables shooting for the rest of the match. First-round use and reporting your victims are configurable.</string>
    <string name="Eclipse.Role.Sheriff.WikiDescription">Win with the Crewmates and complete tasks. Your host configures cooldown, first-round use, victim reporting, valid neutral categories and misfire penalty. Surviving a misfire does not restore shooting.</string>
