    <string name="Eclipse.Role.Jester">Jester</string>
    <string name="Eclipse.Role.Jester.IntroBlurb">Get voted out to win!</string>
    <string name="Eclipse.Role.Jester.MedDescription">A neutral who wins by being voted out. Being murdered does not count.</string>
    <string name="Eclipse.Role.Jester.TabDescription">Get voted out to win. Your host chooses whether your victory ends the game, grants one haunt against a living voter until the next meeting, or simply lets the game continue. Poke is a local notification. Timed venting, impostor vision and Scatter are configurable. Fake tasks do not contribute to Crew progress.</string>
    <string name="Eclipse.Role.Jester.WikiDescription">You win by being the actual ejected player. A tie, murder or Scatter death does not grant victory. You cannot sabotage or travel between vents. Scatter requires moving away from your three recent locations before its timer runs out.</string>
    <string name="Eclipse.Role.NeutralGhost">Neutral ghost</string>
    <string name="Eclipse.Role.NeutralGhost.IntroBlurb">Your original neutral objective determines your victory.</string>
    <string name="Eclipse.Role.NeutralGhost.MedDescription">Keeps the original neutral outcome after death.</string>
    <string name="Eclipse.Role.NeutralGhost.TabDescription">Your victory remains tied to your original neutral role. Observe other players using the ghost ability.</string>
    <string name="Eclipse.Role.NeutralGhost.WikiDescription">Internal ghost role for Eclipse neutrals.</string>
